# The 3-D model previewer build (webui/previewer-dist/) -- PLANNED, NOT PRESENT.
#
# Status verified 2026-08-29:
#   * the directory does not exist on disk;
#   * no code references it -- the only hit anywhere in AssetsManager/ or
#     webui/src/ is a stale comment in panels/file_list/_actions.py;
#   * it was never committed: `git log --all --name-only | grep -i previewer`
#     returns nothing, so there is no lost history to recover.
#
# The old comment here claimed the build was vendored "on purpose" and that
# GET /previewer/* would 503 without it.  That described an intent recorded in
# docs/archive/2026-08/scratch/_quality_audit_2026_08_17.md (which planned a
# 12.95 MB -> 3.19 MB trim), not the state of the tree.  Do not read it as
# current -- the previewer never landed.
#
# The two rules are kept only so that re-vendoring the build, if the previewer
# is ever revived, does not require rediscovering which parts to exclude.
# Delete them together with this comment if the feature is formally dropped.
/webui/previewer-dist/**/*.map
/webui/previewer-dist/samples/

# Local bare mirror (backup of this repo's git history).
/mirror/


# Local pytest basetemp (system temp is locked by a privileged process).
# One glob rather than a per-run name: each session picks a fresh basetemp
# because a crashed run leaves its old directory locked by a stale handle.
/.pytest-*/
/.bt-*/
/pytest-run.log
/pytest-full*.log


# Sandbox probe leftovers (0o700 dirs the sandbox cannot delete).
/.probe-*/
/am-probe-*/


# Local agent tooling config (user-provided .zcode/.agents definitions).
/.agents/


# Ad-hoc inventory/probe listings produced while auditing the tree.
# Root-anchored, so the many legitimately underscore-prefixed module files in
# package subdirectories stay tracked.
/*_files.txt
/_*

# One-off maintenance/repair loops (e.g. audit-manifest fixups); never tracked.
scripts/_tmp_*.py

# Session-memory sidecar (external assistant tooling)
.workbuddy/
